sequenceDiagram
  actor Collector
  participant API as Dues API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Mail as SMTP
  Collector->>API: POST /api/receipts
  API->>API: Check role, department scope and amounts
  API->>DB: BEGIN
  API->>DB: Advisory lock on index number
  API->>DB: Reserve next lifetime sequence
  API->>DB: Insert receipt, payment lines and souvenirs
  API->>DB: COMMIT
  API-->>Collector: Receipt number SOS-DUES-TAG-INDEX-n
  API->>Mail: Send receipt email if configured
  API-->>Collector: Receipt PDF
